_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 2.3%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $799M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 69.2%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.50"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":22.48,"default_fair_val":22.48,"premium_pct":95.2,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":23.2,"pe_forward":20.4,"pb_trailing":2.2,"pb_forward":2,"div_yield":2.66,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":2.04,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":69.2,"cash_to_assets":0.1,"current_ratio":0.5,"roe":9.5,"roa":2.3,"moat":{"ticker":"NI","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"公用事業公司如 NiSource，其品牌價值與定價權相對有限。其業務受嚴格的政府管制，電價和氣價的調整需經過監管機構批准，這大大限制了其自由定價的能力。雖然公司努力提升客戶服務和品牌形象，但與消費品或科技公司相比，其品牌對消費者決策的影響力微乎其微。在高度管制的環境下，其定價權更多地取決於監管政策而非市場競爭力，因此在品牌定價權維度上得分較低。","comment_en":"Utilities companies like NiSource have limited brand value and pricing power. Their operations are strictly regulated by the government, and adjustments to electricity and gas prices require approval from regulatory bodies, significantly restricting their ability to set prices freely. While the company strives to enhance customer service and brand image, its brand influence on consumer decisions is minimal compared to consumer goods or tech companies. In a highly regulated environment, pricing power depends more on regulatory policy than market competitiveness, hence the low score in brand pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"NiSource 作為一家受嚴格管制的公用事業公司，其核心業務（天然氣和電力配送）受到特許經營權的保護。這些特許經營權是政府授予的，具有地域壟斷性質，其他公司難以進入。雖然沒有傳統意義上的專利，但這些監管許可和特許經營權構成了強大的進入壁壘，確保了其在特定區域內的市場地位。這種監管壁壘是其穩定的現金流和業務模式的關鍵，賦予了其較高的護城河分數。","comment_en":"As a strictly regulated utility company, NiSource's core business (natural gas and electricity distribution) is protected by operating franchises. These franchises are granted by the government and possess a regional monopoly nature, making it difficult for other companies to enter. While there are no patents in the traditional sense, these regulatory permits and franchises form strong barriers to entry, securing its market position within specific areas. This regulatory barrier is key to its stable cash flow and business model, granting it a high moat score."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於家庭和企業用戶而言，更換主要的能源供應商（天然氣或電力）涉及較高的轉換成本。這不僅包括潛在的安裝費用和基礎設施連接問題，還涉及到用戶對現有供應商的熟悉度和服務習慣。一旦用戶接入了 NiSource 的管線網絡，更換到另一家供應商的複雜性和不確定性會讓大多數客戶傾向於維持現狀。這種隱性的轉換成本為 NiSource 提供了穩定的客戶基礎和收入來源。","comment_en":"For residential and business customers, switching primary energy suppliers (natural gas or electricity) involves relatively high switching costs. This includes not only potential installation fees and infrastructure connection issues but also user familiarity and service habits with the current provider. Once a customer is connected to NiSource's pipeline network, the complexity and uncertainty of switching to another supplier make most customers inclined to maintain the status quo. These implicit switching costs provide NiSource with a stable customer base and revenue stream."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NiSource 的業務模式主要基於基礎設施的鋪設和維護，例如天然氣管道和電力線路。這種模式本身不具備顯著的網絡效應。用戶的增加並不會直接導致服務價值的指數級提升，也不會形成用戶留存的閉環。雖然龐大的客戶群體可以帶來規模經濟，但這與網絡效應的定義不同。因此，在網絡效應這一維度上，NiSource 的得分非常低。","comment_en":"NiSource's business model is primarily based on the deployment and maintenance of infrastructure, such as natural gas pipelines and power lines. This model inherently lacks significant network effects. An increase in users does not directly lead to an exponential increase in service value, nor does it create a closed loop for customer retention. While a large customer base can bring economies of scale, this differs from the definition of network effects. Therefore, NiSource scores very low on the network effects dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型公用事業公司，NiSource 受益於顯著的規模經濟效應。其龐大的基礎設施網絡（管道、線路）能夠服務大量客戶，攤薄了固定成本。在採購、運營和維護方面，其規模使其能夠獲得更優惠的價格和更高的效率。相較於小型地方性公用事業公司，NiSource 在成本控制和資源調度上具有明顯優勢。這種規模帶來的成本優勢是其維持盈利能力的重要因素。","comment_en":"As a large utility company, NiSource benefits from significant economies of scale. Its extensive infrastructure network (pipelines, lines) serves a large number of customers, spreading fixed costs. In terms of procurement, operations, and maintenance, its scale allows it to obtain more favorable pricing and higher efficiency. Compared to smaller, local utility companies, NiSource has a clear advantage in cost control and resource scheduling. This cost advantage derived from scale is an important factor in maintaining its profitability."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"NiSource 在其服務的特定地理區域內擁有獨特的資產和基礎設施。這些天然氣和電力配送網絡是經過數十年投資和建設形成的，具有高度的地域專屬性。在這些區域內，其基礎設施的鋪設和運營已獲得監管機構的批准，形成了事實上的壟斷。其他競爭者難以複製或替代這些龐大且深入社區的基礎設施，這構成了其獨特的地理資產壁壘。","comment_en":"NiSource possesses unique assets and infrastructure within the specific geographic areas it serves. These natural gas and electricity distribution networks have been developed over decades of investment and construction, possessing a high degree of regional exclusivity. Within these areas, its infrastructure deployment and operation have been approved by regulatory bodies, creating a de facto monopoly. It is difficult for competitors to replicate or replace these extensive infrastructures deeply integrated into communities, forming its unique geographic asset barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NiSource 作為一家成熟的公用事業公司，在運營效率方面有著長期的積累和優化。公司持續投資於基礎設施的升級和維護，以確保供電供氣的穩定性和可靠性。通過技術應用和流程改進，努力降低運營成本和損耗。然而，公用事業行業的運營效率提升空間相對有限，且受到監管約束。雖然 NiSource 在行業內處於中等偏上的水平，但與那些能夠通過顛覆性創新大幅提升效率的公司相比，其得分為中等。","comment_en":"As a mature utility company, NiSource has long-standing experience and optimization in operational efficiency. The company continuously invests in infrastructure upgrades and maintenance to ensure the stability and reliability of power and gas supply. Through technological applications and process improvements, it strives to reduce operating costs and losses. However, the scope for improving operational efficiency in the utility sector is relatively limited and subject to regulatory constraints. While NiSource is in the upper-middle tier within its industry, its score is moderate compared to companies that can significantly enhance efficiency through disruptive innovation."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"NiSource 的資本配置策略主要圍繞著基礎設施的維護、升級和擴張，以及股息支付。作為受監管的公用事業公司，其資本支出相對穩定且可預測，以滿足監管要求和客戶需求。公司在回購股票和併購方面的活動較少。雖然其資本配置旨在維持業務穩定和提供股息，但相較於那些能夠通過精準的戰略投資實現高額回報的公司，其資本配置的靈活性和創造超額價值的潛力有限，得分為中等。","comment_en":"NiSource's capital allocation strategy primarily revolves around infrastructure maintenance, upgrades, and expansion, along with dividend payments. As a regulated utility company, its capital expenditures are relatively stable and predictable, aimed at meeting regulatory requirements and customer demands. The company engages less in share buybacks and mergers and acquisitions. While its capital allocation aims to maintain business stability and provide dividends, its flexibility and potential for creating excess value are limited compared to companies that achieve high returns through precise strategic investments, resulting in a moderate score."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如前所述，由於能源供應的基礎設施特性和用戶習慣，NiSource 擁有較高的客戶保留率。用戶一旦接入其網絡，更換成本較高，且能源供應是生活必需品，需求穩定。公司通過提供可靠的服務和響應客戶需求來維持客戶關係。雖然缺乏像會員計劃那樣的主動鎖定機制，但其業務的本質決定了客戶的穩定性，這為公司提供了可預測的收入流。","comment_en":"As mentioned earlier, due to the infrastructural nature of energy supply and user habits, NiSource enjoys a high customer retention rate. Once users are connected to its network, the switching costs are relatively high, and energy supply is a necessity with stable demand. The company maintains customer relationships by providing reliable service and responding to customer needs. Although it lacks proactive locking mechanisms like loyalty programs, the nature of its business ensures customer stability, providing the company with a predictable revenue stream."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"NiSource 的業務具有高度的持久性。作為提供基礎能源（天然氣和電力）的公用事業公司，其服務是社會運行的必需品，需求相對穩定且不受經濟週期影響。其龐大的基礎設施網絡和特許經營權構成了難以逾越的壁壘。只要社會對能源的需求持續存在，NiSource 的業務就能夠長期穩定地運轉。這種必需性、穩定的需求和強大的進入壁壘，使其業務具有極強的持久性。","comment_en":"NiSource's business possesses high durability. As a utility company providing essential energy (natural gas and electricity), its services are necessities for societal functioning, with relatively stable demand unaffected by economic cycles. Its extensive infrastructure network and operating franchises form insurmountable barriers. As long as society requires energy, NiSource's business can operate stably over the long term. This essential nature, stable demand, and strong entry barriers give its business exceptional durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"NiSource 的護城河主要來自於其受監管的特許經營權和龐大的地理基礎設施網絡（M2, M6），這在特定區域內形成了事實上的壟斷，並帶來了較高的客戶轉換成本（M3）和客戶保留率（M9）。其規模經濟（M5）也提供了成本優勢。然而，其業務缺乏品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）。運營效率（M7）和資本配置（M8）處於行業平均水平。總體而言，NiSource 是一家典型的特許經營型公用事業公司，其護城河的持久性（M10）很高，但成長性和定價權有限。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"NiSource's moat primarily stems from its regulated operating franchises and extensive geographic infrastructure network (M2, M6), creating a de facto monopoly in specific regions and leading to high customer switching costs (M3) and retention rates (M9). Its economies of scale (M5) also provide a cost advantage. However, its business lacks brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4). Operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation (M8) are at industry average levels. Overall, NiSource is a typical franchised utility company with a highly durable moat (M10), but limited growth potential and pricing power.","evidenceHash":"4efc0a33f51ffc64e473bbc1e8b67d08ad4cf1cd6f26e8ff40a9ead65d8f26c3","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T00:03:43.368Z","evidenceHash":"84edca1d83d36e98aa2524c09c15fd86224c0adeb74406ac853078a714bfde52"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T00:03:43.368Z","evidenceHash":"84edca1d83d36e98aa2524c09c15fd86224c0adeb74406ac853078a714bfde52"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NI.png","website":"https://www.nisource.com","ceo":"Lloyd Yates","full_time_employees":"7703","description":"NiSource Inc., an energy holding company, operates as a regulated natural gas and electric utility company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Columbia Operations and NIPSCO Operations. The company provides natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers through approximately 37,300 miles of distribution main pipeline and the associated individual customer service lines; and 310 miles of transmission main pipeline in Ohio, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Kentucky, and Maryland. It also generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.5 million customers in various counties in the northern part of Indiana, as well as engages in wholesale electric and transmission transactions. It owns and operates steam coal generating stations in Wheatfield and Michigan City; combined cycle gas turbine in West Terre Haute; natural gas generating units in Wheatfield; hydro generating plants in Carroll County and White County; wind generating units in White County; and solar generating units in Sullivan County, Gibson County, Jasper County, and White County. The company was formerly known as NIPSCO Industries, Inc. and changed its name to NiSource Inc. in April 1999. NiSource Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Merrillville, Indiana.","description_en":"NiSource Inc., an energy holding company, operates as a regulated natural gas and electric utility company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Columbia Operations and NIPSCO Operations. The company provides natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers through approximately 37,300 miles of distribution main pipeline and the associated individual customer service lines; and 310 miles of transmission main pipeline in Ohio, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Kentucky, and Maryland. It also generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.5 million customers in various counties in the northern part of Indiana, as well as engages in wholesale electric and transmission transactions. It owns and operates steam coal generating stations in Wheatfield and Michigan City; combined cycle gas turbine in West Terre Haute; natural gas generating units in Wheatfield; hydro generating plants in Carroll County and White County; wind generating units in White County; and solar generating units in Sullivan County, Gibson County, Jasper County, and White County. The company was formerly known as NIPSCO Industries, Inc. and changed its name to NiSource Inc. in April 1999. NiSource Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Merrillville, Indiana.",